  "body": "[As Tab Atkins remarked](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7590#issuecomment-1036498179), \r\n\r\n> how many times have you seen something like 106 in a text version of a scientific PDF and had to realize it meant 10<sup>6</sup>?\r\n\r\nThis Issues occured, I think, because `<sup>` doesn't convey any meanings while raising `6` is meaningful.  So I'd like to introduce new semantics with `<exponent>`, meaning that `6` is the exponent of `10`.",
